        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Initialise Flow Params",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const flowParams = {\n  AssignmentId: $context.$triggers.REST.$input.AssignmentId,\n  PersonId: $context.$triggers.REST.$input.PersonId,\n  ActionTypeCode: $context.$triggers.REST.$input.ActionTypeCode,\n  ActionCode: $context.$triggers.REST.$input.ActionCode,\n  ActionId: $context.$triggers.REST.$input.ActionId,\n  FlowType: $context.$triggers.REST.$input.FlowType,\n  LegalEntityId: $context.$triggers.REST.$input.LegalEntityId,\n  EffectiveDate: $context.$triggers.REST.$input.EffectiveDate,\n  DisplayName: $context.$triggers.REST.$input.DisplayName,\n  Query: {\n      Intent: $context.$nodes.GET_INTENT_AND_OPERATION.$output.Intent,\n      Operation: $context.$nodes.GET_INTENT_AND_OPERATION.$output.Operation\n  }\n};\n\nconst actionTypeCompIntentMap = {\n  'CMP_MANAGE_CONTRIBUTIONS' : 'PersonalContributions',\n  'CMP_INDIVIDUAL_COMPENSATION': 'IndividualCompensation',\n  'CMP_ADMIN_INDIV_COMPENSATION': 'AdministerCompensation'\n};\n\nflowParams.CompIntent = actionTypeCompIntentMap[flowParams.ActionTypeCode] ?? 'GHRFlows';\nflowParams.ElementEntryIntent = `ICP__${flowParams.CompIntent}__${flowParams.ActionTypeCode}__${flowParams.ActionCode}`;\nflowParams.ActionId = (flowParams.ActionId || $context.$nodes.CHECK_PRIVILEGE.$output.result.ActionId);\nflowParams.LegalEntityId = (flowParams.LegalEntityId || $context.$nodes.CHECK_PRIVILEGE.$output.result.LegalEntityId);\nflowParams.IsICStandAloneFlow = (flowParams.CompIntent !== 'GHRFlows');\n\n\nreturn flowParams;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1763111911086"
          },
          "code": "INITIALISE_FLOW_PARAMS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1763094307694",
          "id": "1763093173887",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {},
              "code": "ORA_MODEL_CONFIG_PREMIUM_OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "model": "OCI_GPT_5_MINI",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "No Privilege Response"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "NO_PRIVILEGE_RESPONSE",
          "id": "1763094564734",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1763094564735_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Map and Return the Following Output Structure:\n\n1. IsPayload:\nSet this value to false.\n\n2. Message:\nIf {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.ActionTypeCode}} equals CMP_MANAGE_CONTRIBUTIONS, return a polite, user-friendly message informing the user that they do not have permission to add or modify personal contributions.\n\nOtherwise, return a polite, user-friendly message informing the user that they do not have permission to add or modify individual compensation.\nThe message should be clear, respectful, and helpful.\n\n3. BatchPayload:\nReturn an empty array []"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"IsPayload\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"BatchPayload\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"properties\": {}\n            }\n        },\n        \"Message\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {},
              "code": "ORA_MODEL_CONFIG_PREMIUM_OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "model": "OCI_GPT_5_MINI",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "Get Intent And Operation"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1763093173887"
          },
          "code": "GET_INTENT_AND_OPERATION",
          "id": "1763111514629",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1763111514631_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "From the input message ( {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} ), determine the user’s intent regarding Personal Contributions. Classify the intent into EXACTLY ONE of the following Intents based on the user’s primary goal:\n\n*Intents*\nQUERY — The user wants to retrieve existing information about their contributions, allocations, balances, enrollment status, etc.\nCHECK_ELIGIBILITY — The user is asking whether they are eligible to enroll, whether enrollment is open, or similar eligibility-based questions.\nTRANSACTION — The user wants to take an action affecting a personal contribution plan (enroll/create, modify, increase/decrease, remove/delete, raise/raise a request).\n\n** If Intent is TRANSACTION, determine the Operation which is a more granular classification \n\n**TRANSACTION Operation Types**\nOnly determine Operation if Intent is TRANSACTION.\n\n CREATE — The user wants to enroll in or add a new personal contribution plan.\n Keywords: enroll, sign up, start contributing, begin, add, raise, raise a request\n\n UPDATE — The user wants to modify an existing contribution plan.\n Keywords: change, edit, modify, update, increase, decrease, adjust\n\n DELETE — The user wants to stop/remove/end a contribution plan.\n Keywords: delete, stop, cancel, remove, withdraw, terminate\n\nIf the user explicitly expresses intent to stop/cancel/remove a contribution, choose DELETE.\nIf Intent is not TRANSACTION, set Operation to null.\n\n**Classification Rules**\n- If the user is asking for current state, status, or details of their contributions, choose QUERY.\n- If the user is asking whether they can enrol, are eligible, or whether enrollment is possible/open, choose CHECK_ELIGIBILITY.\n- If the user expresses a desire to perform a change (enrol, modify, increase, decrease, cancel, delete, withdraw, update), choose TRANSACTION.\n- If the intent is unclear, favour QUERY\n\n**Output**\nReturn and map the Intent \nIf Intent is not TRANSACTION, set Operation to null.\n\n\n**Sample Utterances**\nQUERY\n\"Show me my current personal contributions.\"\n\"What’s my current contribution percentage?\"\n\"How much have I allocated this year?\"\n\"Where is my money allocated currently?\"\n\"What plans am I currently enrolled in?\"\n\"Do I have any active contribution plans?\"\n\"How much did I contribute last month?\"\n\"Break down my allocations by plan.\"\n\"Give me a summary of my contributions.\"\n\"What’s my contribution towards retirement?\"\n\nCHECK_ELIGIBILITY\n\"Am I allowed to enroll in voluntary contributions?\"\n\"Can I start a personal contribution plan?\"\n\"Who is eligible for this plan?\"\n\"Is this plan available for me?\"\n\"Can employees in my region enroll?\"\n\"Is the window open to start contributions?\"\n\"What are the eligibility rules?\"\n\"Am I eligible at my tenure?\"\n\"Can I participate this quarter?\"\n\"Can I apply for this contribution scheme?\"\n\nTRANSACTION — CREATE\n\"Enroll me into the voluntary contribution plan.\"\n\"Raise an overtime request\"\n\"Add a contribution of 5% to the retirement plan.\"\n\"Start contributing to the savings plan.\"\n\"Set up a contribution for pension.\"\n\"I want to begin contributing to that plan.\"\n\"Create a new contribution at 4%.\"\n\"Sign me up for flexible contributions.\"\n\"Add me to the matching contribution plan.\"\n\"Enable contributions for the investment plan.\"\n\"Begin a new contribution.\"\n\nTRANSACTION — UPDATE\n\"Decrease my contribution to 8%.\"\n\"Modify my voluntary contribution.\"\n\"Edit the contribution amount.\"\n\"Change the allocation to 70/30.\"\n\"Adjust my contribution for the savings plan.\"\n\"Update the percentage to 6%.\"\n\"Boost my contribution by 2%.\"\n\"Shift more funds to equity.\"\n\"Revise my current personal contribution.\"\n\nTRANSACTION — DELETE\n\"Cancel my savings contribution.\"\n\"Stop contributing to that plan.\"\n\"Disable my contribution from next month.\"\n\"Remove my personal contribution.\"\n\"Withdraw from that plan.\"\n\"Terminate my voluntary contribution.\"\n\"Delete my existing contribution plan.\"\n\"End contributions permanently.\"\n\"Turn off the retirement contribution.\"\n\"Cease payments to this plan.\"\n\nEdge-Case Language Variants\nQUERY\n\"What do I currently contribute?\"\n\"Am I already in this plan?\"\n\"Show my allocations historically.\"\n\nCHECK_ELIGIBILITY\n\"Will I be able to enroll next month?\"\n\"Is enrollment allowed for my grade level?\"\n\nCREATE\n\"I'd like to start contributing.\"\n\"Please set up contributions for me.\"\n\"Raise a claim\"\n\nUPDATE\n\"Tune my contribution.\"\n\"Rebalance my allocations.\"\n\nDELETE\n\"Pause my contribution indefinitely.\"\n\"Shut off this plan.\""
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"Operation\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"Intent\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
