          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"items\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"ComponentId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"PlanId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"ComponentName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"DocumentTypeId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"ElementTypeId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"EndDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"EndDateCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"InputCurrencyCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"NonMonetaryUOM\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"ProcessingType\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"StartDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"StartDateCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"RequiresAttachment\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}",
          "type": "BO_FUNCTION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Map Eligible Plans And Options",
            "returnType": "array",
            "sourceCode": "let eligiblePlans = $context.$nodes.GET_ELIGIBLE_PLANS.$output.items;\nlet eligibleOptions = $context.$nodes.GET_ELIGIBLE_OPTIONS.$output.items;\n\nconst planLookupById = eligiblePlans.reduce((lookup, plan) => { lookup[plan.PlanId] = plan; return lookup; }, {});\nlet flattenedPlanComponents = eligibleOptions.map(component => ({ ...planLookupById[component.PlanId], ...component }));\n\nreturn flattenedPlanComponents;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1763115071926"
          },
          "code": "MAP_ELIGIBLE_PLANS_AND_OPTIONS",
          "id": "1763114954034",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {},
              "code": "ORA_MODEL_CONFIG_PREMIUM_OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "model": "OCI_GPT_5_MINI",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "Get Selected Plan Option"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1763115501895"
          },
          "code": "GET_SELECTED_PLAN_OPTION",
          "id": "1763115071926",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1763115071928_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Using the eligible plan options located at:\n{{$context.$nodes.MAP_ELIGIBLE_PLANS_AND_OPTIONS.$output.result}},\n\nidentify and return the plan option object that corresponds to the plan referenced in:\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nSTRICT MATCHING RULES (MANDATORY):\n\n1. Match the input ONLY against:\n   - PlanName\n   - ComponentName\n\n2. Matching must be based on:\n   - Exact phrase match, OR\n   - Strong lexical overlap (same words in same order, allowing minor variations like pluralization or case differences)\n\n3. DO NOT:\n   - Use semantic similarity\n   - Infer intent\n   - Treat synonyms as equivalent\n   - Match based on category, theme, or meaning\n   - Match generic terms like \"award\", \"bonus\", \"recognition\", or \"performance\" alone\n\n4. A match is VALID only if:\n   - At least 70% of the meaningful words in the user input\n     appear verbatim in either PlanName or ComponentName\n\n5. If multiple valid matches exist:\n   - Select the one with the highest exact lexical overlap\n   - Prefer PlanName matches over ComponentName\n\nOUTPUT RULES:\n\n- If a valid match is found:\n  - Map the matched object to `selectedPlanOption`\n  - Set `planOptionFound` to true\n\n- If no valid match is found:\n  - Set `planOptionFound` to false\n  - Set `message` to a polite, user-friendly message stating that the plan was not found which indicates either the user is not eligible for the plan or the plan doesn't exist."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"message\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"planOptionFound\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"selectedPlanOption\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {}\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
