              "id": "1764667734894_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Map and Return the Following Output Structure:\n\n1. IsPayload:\nSet this value to false.\n\n2. Message:\nReturn a single, polite, and user-friendly message informing the user that the requested operation is not currently supported.\n\nIn the same message:\n- Clearly explain what the agent can help with, limited to:\n  - Querying current allocations\n  - Checking for plan eligibility\n  - Creating new allocations with user-enterable fields\n- The agent does NOT support allocations involving stocks, documents of record, or budgets.\n\nMessage Guidelines:\n- Keep the response concise, polite, and user-friendly.\n- Do NOT mention internal action codes, system logic, or technical details.\n- Do NOT suggest workarounds or imply how permissions can be bypassed.\n- Do NOT invent, assume, or infer any information.\n- Return only the final message text.\n\n3. BatchPayload:\nReturn an empty array []"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"BatchPayload\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"properties\": {}\n            }\n        },\n        \"Message\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"IsPayload\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
